# Michael J. Bayard Construction ADR

> Smart Solutions in Conflict Resolution

## Practice Areas
- [Construction Mediation](https://constructionadrservices.com/practice-areas/construction-mediation.md): Bridging Differences For Project Success
- [Construction Arbitration](https://constructionadrservices.com/practice-areas/construction-arbitration.md): Arbitration is a formal process where a neutral arbitrator reviews evidence and issues a binding decision, providing a structured alternative to litigation.
- [Construction Neutral Evaluation](https://constructionadrservices.com/practice-areas/construction-neutral-evaluation.md): We specialize in resolving contract-related disputes, whether they involve payment issues, scope changes, delays, or other contract matters.
- [Construction Defect Claims](https://constructionadrservices.com/practice-areas/construction-defect-claims.md): Our expertise extends to resolving disputes related to construction defects, ensuring a fair and equitable resolution.
- [Design and Engineering Disputes](https://constructionadrservices.com/practice-areas/design-and-engineering-disputes.md): We assist in resolving disputes related to design and engineering issues, helping parties find solutions that adhere to industry standards.
- [Project Delay Claims](https://constructionadrservices.com/practice-areas/project-delay-claims.md): Timely project completion is vital in construction. Our ADR services address disputes arising from project delays to keep construction projects on track.

